s mortality INCLUSION CRITERIA: 1) Children aged more than 28 days to completed 15 years 2) Confirmed Dengue Fever (NS1 positive by ELISA / Dengue IgM positive by ELISA 3) Children with Dengue fever with Warning Signs and /or Compensated Shock
